"P856364347" ""
// SendOffString :
"P3120288712" "The esteemed Doctor James Harvan has requested an audience with you. I have heard nearly as much about this man as I have about you, {HeroName}. His expertise in the mythos behind Pandora's Box is unrivalled.<br><br>Though, I am sure that you know this already. Your secretary has allowed him some limited freedom in the Rogue Isles, but she assures me that he is still kept under close watch. You will find him nearby, if you choose to honor his request."
// TaskTitle :
"P1809532720" "<color deepskyblue>Devil Take the Hindmost</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3008459331" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: The Old and the New</color>"

