"P2036647778" "You have gained some crucial info here, and you seem to have swayed Captain Mako as well."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound1_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P7215858" "Return to James Harvan"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1825710434" "Doctor Harvan will surely be interested in your findings, {HeroName}. You should speak with him, so that you may combine your knowledge with his."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4240915689" "After speaking with Doctor Harvan, you're now confident in your findings. Pandora's Box is somewhere inside Zigursky Penitentiary."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P188098452" "<color orange>As you relate your experiences to Socrates, his broad smile fades into a scowl.</color><br><br>I am ecstatic that you have made this discovery, {HeroName}, but... I wonder if Captain Mako is a man you can trust. It strikes me that he is not in the habit of following others.<br><br>Regardless, it seems that you have uncovered some information critical to our quest. I shall call together a meeting, so that your discoveries may be discussed in a safer environment."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - LastriTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page TaskIncomplete Text :
"P2965799034" "Good to see you again, {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}. Doctor Harvan has given me the gist of your findings.<br><br>I believe that we currently have an information advantage over Arachnos, and any other parties interested in Pandora's Box. If we're going to press that advantage, immediate action must be taken."
// Answer Text :
"P3303381443" "What did you have in mind?"
// Page Lastri1 Text :
"P2865008018" "Our primary goal is to enter Zigursky prison, and to acquire Pandora's Box. However, there are secondary considerations that must be taken into account. Zigursky is well-fortified, and any overt actions in Brickstown would immediately tip off our rivals that there is something of interest in that area.<br><br>Furthermore, there are organizations, such as Longbow or the Freedom Phalanx, that have significantly easier access to the facility than we do. If an armed intrusion into Zigursky became prolonged, local authorities would have the chance to bypass Zigursky's security and beat us to the Box.<br><br>For these reasons, I recommend against a frontal assault. However...<br><br><color orange>Lastri smiles, tapping her notebook with her pen.</color><br><br>There are <i>other</i> ways of gaining access to a prison."
// Answer Text :
"P2647755132" "What, exactly, are you suggesting?"
// Page Lastri2 Text :
"P2972205476" "A diversionary attack. We focus our efforts on a location we know is unrelated to Pandora's Box. If that location is also within Paragon City limits, we achieve two aims at once: we divert the attention of our rivals, while also establishing you as a high-profile threat in Paragon.<br><br>If you were then to... 'turn yourself in...'"
// Answer Text :
"P2197111603" "I like it. How do we proceed?"
// Page Lastri3 Text :
"P290653884" "Preparations have already been made, {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}. My employer has offered his assistance in bypassing the War Walls around Talos Island, and I've made sure the local PPD branch has been tipped off. They're prepared for an incursion.<br><br>We'll need to hit them hard, and cause as much destruction as we can. If you can break their strongest lines of defense, it should prompt a more serious reponse.<br><br>I suggest that a small force, consisting of you, Captain Castillo, and Mr. Hill would be appropriate. It's already well-known that you're working together to find Pandora's Box, and all three of you are individually powerful enough to warrant incarceration in Zigursky."
// Answer Text :
"P2622079784" "What about Mako? Have we gotten a response from him?"
// Page Lastri4 Text :
"P3318071560" "Captain Mako is maintaining his post, for now. He has neither confirmed nor denied his interest in becoming a part of your organization. However...<br><br><color orange>Lastri tries, and fails, to suppress a grin.</color><br><br>He did send us a token of his... 'goodwill'."
// Answer Text :
"P2878601477" "And what would that be?"
// Page Lastri5 Text :
"P3390323200" "I'm sure you'll want to see for yourself, {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}. We picked it up on our way here... you'll find it on the outer deck."
// Answer Text :
"P1161113944" "Okay... I guess I'll go check it out, then."
// Page TaskComplete Text :
"P3608726218" "Whenever you're ready to proceed, feel free to exit the Mitscher. You'll find Captain Mako's 'token of goodwill' outside."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - OdysseusTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3692578672" "{HeroName}. Fantastic work on the Box's location. Harvan's proved to be quite the asset, hasn't he?"
// Answer Text :
"P919940112" "So far, yes. Thanks for the referral."
// Page Odysseus1 Text :
"P2111604570" "Well, that's actually what I wanted to talk to you about.<br><br><color orange>Odysseus leans in close, and begins to speak under his breath.</color><br><br>There's something about his story that doesn't quite add up, {HeroName}. Harvan's well-known in his field, but his father is a mystery to me.<br><br>I did some digging, but what I've found has been sparse at best. I uncovered some official stuff – birth certificate, records of his time at Oxford, things like that. But beyond those, there's nothing. No mentions of an Isaiah Harvan in any trade publications or published works, no photos, no wedding announcements... {HeroName}, I couldn't even find an obituary for the guy."
// Answer Text :
"P2090221472" "So, what's your theory?"
// Page Odysseus2 Text :
"P1119349588" "I don't know, {HeroName}. All I know is that something about Harvan doesn't add up. If his father's work was as groundbreaking as he claims, you'd think there would be some written evidence of that.<br><br>Look, he sent you into that office to find out what happened to his father, right? He said it was related to his disappearance? So, did you find anything related to Isaiah Harvan while you were there?"
// Answer Text :
"P230070921" "Well... no."
// Page Odysseus3 Text :
"P979610254" "Yeah. I didn't think so.<br><br>Harvan's useful, and he's gotten us this far. I'm just saying... we need to keep an eye on him. There's more to him than he's letting on, and I don't like it."
// Answer Text :
"P1478659399" "Noted. Thanks for the warning."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CastilloTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3289082153" "{HeroName}! I am most pleased that you and I will once again be side by side on the field of battle! Our combined capabilities will become truly magnificent, yes?"
// Answer Text :
"P4131036385" "Looking forward to it, Castillo."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - HarrimanTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1863451446" "<color orange>Lieutenant Harriman nods to you respectfully, then turns his attention back to his duties."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - HarvanTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3235088865" "<color orange>Harvan's eyes are wide, as he repeatedly attempts to suppress a grin.</color><br><br>We are on the verge of an amazing breakthrough, {HeroName}. I have to say, I never imagined I would come this close to finding Pandora's Box... especially not this early in my career! Hah-ha!<br><br>Oh, I'm so excited. I can't wait to rub this in Dr. Bell's face. Can you <i>believe</i> that she had the temerity to claim that Pandora's Box was actually a <i>jar</i>? It boggles the mind what kinds of intellectual gymnastics were required to reach that sort of conclusion. Why, just a few years ago I was working on a site in Macedonia...<br><br><color orange>Harvan seems to be lost in his own ramblings.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1366743519" "The lovely Ms. Kayumanis has agreed to assemble your allies aboard the U.S.S. Mitscher. They await your pleasure, {HeroName}."
// AcceptString :
"P39774612" "I'll head out to meet them, then."
// SendOffString :
"P3057818407" "<color orange>Socrates smiles broadly at you.</color><br><br>To think that the searching is finally over... and soon, we will have possession of enough power to establish dominion over the world! Truly, you are an inspiration to me, {HeroName}. I am glad that the Warriors are able to call you 'ally'."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3549223201" "Establish a Plan of Action"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2369601226" "A good leader knows when to wait, {HeroName}, but... if I may be so bold, I do not think this is one of those times. We are closer than ever to finding Pandora's Box, but we do not have it yet. Time is still of the essence."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3655104700" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: A Sound in the East</color>"

