"P16307648" "You have defeated Luminary, but your work here isn't done yet."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2045090010" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon>I hope you like it, {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}. I've already had it swept for any sort of surveillance devices or traps. It appears to be clean.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon>Official Arachnos records report that this vehicle was 'stolen' shortly after leaving the production line. Captain Mako sends his regards."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4208977188" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon> {Hero.gender=male Sir|Ma'am}, the Mitscher is picking up transmissions from the Freedom Phalanx headquarters. They've sent Ms. Yin to stall your attack.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon>If you were to defeat her, I believe we will have created enough of a distraction to depart."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P688842070" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon> {Hero.gender=male Sir|Ma'am}, you appear to be drawing some attention. Local Hero forces have been dispatched, and are converging on your location.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon>I believe you have a significant strength advantage against the current forces they've deployed. Still, I would recommend proceeding with caution."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3126877660" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon> {Hero.gender=male Sir|Ma'am}, another local Hero is approaching your location. Please be on guard."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3219512720" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon> {Hero.gender=male Sir|Ma'am}, another Hero is incoming... honestly, the response time on this is somewhat disappointing. It's clear that the Talos authorities do not know who they're dealing with."

